WEBVTT

00:11:58.046 --> 00:12:00.507
We've gone online into echo chambers.

00:12:00.924 --> 00:12:06.805
But now, more than ever, is a time
when we need to jump out of our fishbowl.

00:12:07.306 --> 00:12:09.016
Go talk to other fish.

00:12:09.308 --> 00:12:10.976
Widen our lens.

00:12:12.102 --> 00:12:16.064
Not just so that we can understand
the rest of the world,

00:12:16.064 --> 00:12:17.441
which we need to.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:23.030
But also so that we can understand
ourselves better, too.

00:12:23.322 --> 00:12:27.201
And just think of that when you see a dog,

00:12:27.201 --> 00:12:28.911
a Kit Kat bar,

00:12:28.952 --> 00:12:31.205
a face mask or your cellphone.